# E-3 evidence: `open link "url" in the app` — deep link routed via OS
# intent handling, not the Dart agent's url_launcher (external browser).
#
# Proof strategy: first open an https:// link WITHOUT "in the app" (the
# existing, unchanged behavior — brings up an external browser, backgrounding
# water-sip), then use the new "in the app" form with water-sip's own
# registered watersip:// scheme, and confirm water-sip is back in the
# foreground — proving the OS actually routed the second URL to the app,
# not just that the app happened to already be there.

before each test
  restart the app
  wait until "Quick Add" appears

test "open link in the app brings water-sip back to foreground from a browser"
  open link "https://example.com"
  wait 3 seconds
  verify external browser opened
  open link "watersip://e3-evidence-deep-link" in the app
  wait 3 seconds
  see "Quick Add"
  take a screenshot called "e3_back_in_app_after_deep_link"
